      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i didnt know about the reyes thing. but i'm out of the kids stuff and i really dont want to have to drive to the pharmacy in the middle of the night if he's crying this much. is there just a way I can split the adult ones so the dose is small enough to be safe for him? like if i just give him a tiny piece of a pill it wouldnt be enough to cause that syndrome, right?",
